WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.717
The camera circles the black hole while its inclination falls from 75 to 20 degrees. The disk is nearly face on and forms a ring around the shadow.

00:03.717 --> 00:08.717
The camera circles the black hole while its inclination rises from 20 to 85 degrees. The disk is close to edge on, light from its far side is bent over the shadow and its underside shows below it.

00:08.717 --> 00:10.000
The camera circles the black hole while its inclination falls from 85 to 75 degrees. The disk is close to edge on, light from its far side is bent over the shadow and its underside shows below it.
